  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Regional Sub-Saharan Africa: Healthcare Innovation Reverse Trade Mission Series, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This healthcare-focused reverse trade mission (RTM) series consists of two separate and distinct RTMs, each of which connect healthcare sector representatives from sub-Saharan Africa with U.S. companies seeking to provide healthcare equipment and services to the sub-Saharan Africa market, with a focus on health information technology (IT), hospital infrastructure, and medical devices. The RTMs showcase U.S. technologies and services to representatives from Sub-Saharan Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
